      "summary": ": Today at Cardrona 16 August 2026 — Cardrona is open with cold temperatures, light winds and mostly fine conditions expected. The resort reports excellent mid-winter snow, with 2 cm of snow in the last 24 hours and overnight grooming and snowmaking producing good corduroy for Sunday laps. Kindy Conveyor, Learner Conveyors, McDougall’s Chondola, Whitestar Express, Valley View, Captains Express, T-Bar and Soho Express are open. Willow’s Quad is on hold, while Wells Pipe Platter is closed. Learners Slope, Main Basin, Captains, Soho, Ski Touring Access, Mt Cardrona, Arcadia Chutes and Summit are open. Little Willows and Big Willows are on hold. Baby Bucks, Little Bucks, Antlers Alley, Stag Lane and Big Bucks are open; Peoples Pipe, Olympic Pipe, Big Air and Gravity Cross are closed. The access road is chain free, but chains must be carried. Carparks are full, with the Pines shuttles operating and the road running one-in, one-out.",
